/ String vectors: space-separated strings. Parens keep one apart from
/ neighbouring values (and `log` treats bare juxtaposition as separate items).
names: ("ann" "bob" "cy")
names
log ("ann" "bob") " and " "cy"

/ enlist: the one-element list of an atom
enlist 23
enlist "solo"
enlist `sym

/ ? (roll): random draws with replacement
3?6                       / 3 ints in 0..5
2 ? 10 20 30 40           / 2 picks from a list
5 ? names                 / picks from a string vector
4 ? `buy`sell             / picks from a symbol vector
3?1.0                     / 3 floats in [0, 1)
picks: 4 ? trades`price   / from a table column
picks
